sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Platform Admin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Controller as AIGateway Controller<br/>Deployment
    participant DSCI as DSCInitialization CR
    participant Kustomize as Kustomize Renderer
    participant BatchNS as Applications Namespace<br/>(Batch Gateway Resources)
    participant MaaSNS as Applications Namespace<br/>(MaaS Resources)
    participant CertMgr as cert-manager
    participant GW as Gateway API
    participant Kuadrant as Kuadrant
    participant Istio as Istio
    participant Prom as prometheus-operator
    participant OTel as OpenTelemetry

    Note over Admin,Controller: AIGateway CR Reconciliation Flow

    Admin->>K8sAPI: Create/Update AIGateway CR<br/>(default-aigateway, cluster-scoped)
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Watch event: AIGateway CR changed

    Controller->>K8sAPI: GET DSCInitialization<br/>ServiceAccount token auth
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Platform init state

    Controller->>Controller: Evaluate managementState<br/>for each sub-component

    alt spec.batchGateway.managementState == Managed
        Controller->>Kustomize: Render batch-gateway manifests
        Kustomize-->>Controller: Rendered resources
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Apply LLMBatchGateway CRDs<br/>Deployments, Services, RBAC
        K8sAPI-->>BatchNS: Resources created/updated
    end

    alt spec.modelsAsService.managementState == Managed
        Controller->>Kustomize: Render MaaS manifests
        Kustomize-->>Controller: Rendered resources
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Apply MaaS CRDs<br/>ExternalModels, ExternalProviders
        K8sAPI-->>MaaSNS: Resources created/updated
    end

    Note over Controller,Istio: Platform Integration Setup

    Controller->>CertMgr: Create/Update Certificate CRs<br/>TLS 1.2+
    Controller->>GW: Create/Update HTTPRoutes<br/>TLS 1.2+
    Controller->>Kuadrant: Create/Update AuthPolicies<br/>+ RateLimitPolicies
    Controller->>Istio: Create/Update DestinationRules<br/>+ ServiceEntries + EnvoyFilters
    Controller->>Prom: Create/Update ServiceMonitors<br/>+ PrometheusRules
    Controller->>OTel: Create/Update OTel Collectors

    Note over Controller: Status Update

    Controller->>K8sAPI: PATCH AIGateway/status<br/>module version, conditions,<br/>per-sub-module Ready conditions

    Note over Controller: Health & Metrics Endpoints

    Controller-->>Controller: /healthz, /readyz (8081/HTTP)<br/>Unauthenticated
    Controller-->>Controller: Metrics (8443/TCP TLS)<br/>TokenReview + RBAC auth
